# Thomas Ray Publishing website: how each git-ignored path is kept identical on both Macs.
# Convention and commands: ~/.claude/TRP_Machine_Sync.md  (tool: ~/.claude/scripts/trp-sync)
# This repo is PUBLIC: anything not meant for the site stays out of git.

# Private: real files in iCloud Drive (TRP-Private/thomasraypublishing/...), symlinked here.
private Feedback/
private Research/
private prototypes/
private Top Website.zip
private Production-Ready Privacy Policy and Terms of Use Templates for iOS Developers.pdf
